('APX-C-3185', '3185', 'Style Video', 'Cinematic live-action style video. A dimly lit bedroom at night. Extremely shallow (F1.2), with perfect focus only on the parrot in the foreground and a heavily blurred background. No UI or text on screen.', null, null, 'https://x.com/genel_ai/status/2043296619190493381', 'Cinematic 8K live-action style video. A dimly lit bedroom at night. Extremely shallow depth of field (F1.2), with perfect focus only on the parrot in the foreground and a heavily blurred background. No UI or text on screen. The protagonist is a tiny rosy-faced lovebird with pale blue feathers, a white face, and bright pink round cheeks. It is tucked under a thick white duvet with a leaf pattern. The parrot sticks its left foot out from under the duvet and is swiping with its tiny claws on a glowing smartphone screen placed in front of it. The light from the smartphone illuminates its face in a pale blue glow. Suddenly, sensing approaching footsteps, the parrot freezes completely. Its eyes are wide and alert. The parrot quickly pushes the phone deep inside its body and the duvet to completely hide the light, closes its eyes tightly, sinks deep into the duvet, and performs a perfect "pretending to sleep" act. Immediately after, in the heavily blurred background, a wooden door opens, and warm orange light from the hallway shines in. The silhouette of the owner, whose face is unrecognizable due to the heavy blur, peeks into the room. The parrot in the foreground remains in focus, holding its breath and staying perfectly still.', null, null, 'missing', 5, 'keep', 'pass', 'aspirational', 'photoreal', null, '24fps-cinematic', 'none', null, 'offline real-world gate: real-world: photoreal, handheld', 'seedance_2.0', '@genel_ai', 'https://x.com/genel_ai', null, null),
