('APX-C-3181', '3181', '\"The Scent of Personas\"\nCore Burst Point', '\"The Scent of Personas\"\nCore burst point: Visualizing \"smell.\" Use the mist from spraying perfume at the camera as a transition medium; each perfume represents a completely different persona.\n0-3s: [Woody Cold Tone - Aloof Queen] Action: Extremely close-up shot.', 15, null, 'https://x.com/Cosmoslucy13/status/2043260367753912734', '\"The Scent of Personas\"\nCore burst point: Visualizing \"smell.\" Use the mist from spraying perfume at the camera as a transition medium; each perfume represents a completely different persona.\n0-3s: [Woody Cold Tone - Aloof Queen] Action: Extremely close-up shot. She@Image1 wears clothes matching the scene''s tone, referring only to character facial consistency. Other styling based on scene needs. She holds a dark vintage perfume bottle and lightly sprays it towards the camera. Transformation: Fine mist instantly blurs the screen, then it clears. She wears a dark gray suit skirt, long hair in a slicked-back style, and a sharp gaze. Environment: Cold tones, minimalist concrete wall background.\n3-8s: [Floral Warm Tone - Sweet Idol] Action: She takes out a pink perfume bottle from behind her and draws a circle in the air, spinning her body along the circle. Transformation: As she rotates, the suit shatters into thousands of petals, turning into a pink lace sequin dress. Environment: Warm sunset, cherry blossom special effects floating in the air.\n8-15s: [Ocean Tone - Agile Mermaid] Action: She pours a bottle of blue perfume directly onto the lens (special effect), creating an \"entering water\" sensation. Transformation: High-frequency rapid beat-sync. She wears a sea-blue laser-textured long dress, wet hair look, and pearls on her cheekbones.\nSound Effects: Instantly switch from muffled underwater sounds to high-pitched electronic music climax.', null, null, 'missing', 3, 'keep', 'pass', 'aspirational', 'stylized-real', null, '24fps-cinematic', 'none', null,