('APX-C-3184', '3184', 'Japanese Girl Around 13 Years Old', 'A Japanese girl around 13 years old. Short black hair with a delicate adolescent expression, mixing anxiety and expectation. Wearing a simple black A-line knee-length dress with slightly puffed long sleeves and no decoration. Black tights and simple flat shoes. A large red ribbon on her head.', null, null, 'https://x.com/AIakira23/status/2043253087335502271', 'A Japanese girl around 13 years old. Short black hair with a delicate adolescent expression, mixing anxiety and expectation. Wearing a simple black A-line knee-length dress with slightly puffed long sleeves and no decoration. Black tights and simple flat shoes. A large red ribbon on her head. The girl is straddling a bamboo broom, sitting firmly with both legs. She is leaning forward, gripping the handle with both hands, clearly maneuvering and flying the broom. The setting is a quiet residential area at night. A European-style house on a green hill with white walls, wooden textures, a triangular roof, and a chimney. The house sits normally on the ground surrounded by gardens and greenery. A full moon in the sky illuminates everything with soft moonlight. The girl slowly floats up from the eaves of the house and ascends into the night sky. The ribbon and skirt flutter naturally in the wind. The camera follows smoothly from behind, capturing the movement from floating to ascending in a single sequence. Realistic yet cinematic, nostalgic, and slightly fantastical tone.', null, null, 'missing', 4, 'keep', 'pass', 'aspirational', 'stylized-real', null, '24fps-cinematic', 'none', null, 'offline real-world gate: real-world: fashion', 'seedance_2.0', '@AIakira23', 'https://x.com/AIakira23', null, null),
