('APX-S-2968-1', 'APX-C-2968', 1, null, null, null, 'VISUAL STYLE: Use live-action feature film realism with crisp action-camera sharpness and prehistoric atmospheric haze. Subtle motion blur from vibration, micro-jitters from suspension stress. CHARACTERS: Define a strict POV with mud-slick gloved hands gripping a dirt bike handlebar. Right hand aggressively feathering a sticking throttle, left hand riding a loose clutch lever. Boots locked onto vibrating foot pegs. Multiple massive prehistoric predators crossing and reacting to the path.', null, null, 'VISUAL STYLE: Use live-action feature film realism with crisp action-camera sharpness and prehistoric atmospheric haze. Subtle from vibration, micro-jitters from suspension stress.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-2968-2', 'APX-C-2968', 2, null, null, null, 'STAGE: A vast prehistoric canyon descending into dense fern canopy, a narrow river corridor, and a churned mud clearing under harsh daylight haze. EMOTIONAL TARGET: Escalate from adrenaline control → mechanical failure → irreversible hunted panic. COLOR LOGIC: Naturalistic Film Print Emulation with dust diffusion and sun-baked highlights. ⏱️ TIMELINE 00:00.0 Open on a hard POV at the canyon edge. Ultra-wide 14mm action lens. Engine already screaming too high — throttle is partially stuck.', null, null, 'STAGE: A vast prehistoric canyon descending into dense fern canopy, a narrow river corridor, and a churned mud clearing under harsh daylight haze.', null, null, null, null, 'canyon, river', null),
('APX-S-2968-3', 'APX-C-2968', 3, null, null, null, 'The bike lurches forward violently without full control. Hands fight the bar as the front wheel drops over the edge into a steep descent. SFX: Engine over-revving, chain rattle, gravel spray, wind blast. 00:03.2 Maintain uninterrupted POV. Bomb through dense treetop gaps and uneven terrain. A massive long-neck herbivore crosses ahead — the rider jerks the bar, barely missing its swinging neck. Throttle spikes unpredictably mid-turn. SFX: Engine surge spikes, deep animal bellow, branches snapping.', null, null, 'A massive long-neck herbivore crosses ahead — the rider jerks the bar, barely missing its swinging neck.', 'driver', null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-2968-4', 'APX-C-2968', 4, null, null, null, '00:06.5 Dive into a narrow river corridor. Wet rock and mud reduce traction — rear tire fishtails violently. A flock of pterosaurs erupts across the path. The rider slips the clutch desperately to regain control, but revs surge again. SFX: Tire slipping, water spray, frantic wingbeats, engine scream. 00:09.8 Blast out of the river bend into thick mud. The throttle sticks wide open. The rider tries braking — response is weak. Speed becomes uncontrollable.', null, null, 'The rider slips the clutch desperately to regain control, but revs surge again. The rider tries braking — response is weak.', 'driver', null, null, null, 'river', null),
('APX-S-2968-5', 'APX-C-2968', 5, null, null, null, 'The bike bucks hard, suspension slamming. SFX: Engine maxed out, brake squeal fading, mud tearing under tire. 00:12.4 Lose stability — partial wipeout. The bike skids sideways, camera dips violently but stays POV. Boots slam into mud, hands still gripping as momentum drags forward. 00:13.6 At ground level, stagger forward two steps after release. Breathing heavy. Look up— A charging Spinosaurus bursts through river mist, jaws wide, closing distance instantly until teeth fill the frame.', null, null, 'The bike bucks hard, suspension slamming. 4 Lose stability — partial wipeout. The bike skids sideways, camera dips violently but stays POV. Boots slam into mud, hands still gripping as momentum drags forward.', null, null, null, null, 'river', null),
('APX-S-2968-6', 'APX-C-2968', 6, null, null, null, 'SFX: Ground-shaking impacts, guttural roar, snapping jaws, abrupt cut. 🚫 EXCLUDE Avoid third-person cuts, clean/stable riding, perfect control, teleporting terrain, frozen creatures, modern polished bike aesthetics, impossible recovery from skids, unrealistic suspension behavior.', null, null, '🚫 EXCLUDE Avoid third-person cuts, clean/stable riding, perfect control, teleporting terrain, frozen creatures, modern polished bike aesthetics, impossible recovery from skids, unrealistic suspension behavior.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
