('APX-S-2898-1', 'APX-C-2898', 1, null, null, null, 'Hyperrealistic catastrophic ocean event, extreme scale, violent water physics, ground-level survival perspective, continuous sprint motion, debris, wind force, pressure impact, high-speed destruction, no pauses, hard cuts only, no fade, no dissolve, no morph transition Shot 1: Camera running at full speed along a beach, people already screaming, wind building violently Cut to Shot 2: Turn a massive vertical wall of water already collapsing forward at high speed Cut to Shot 3: Sprint through sand and obstacles, camera shaking heavily, debris hitting lens Cut to Shot 4: Shockwave of air pressure hits before water, knocking people down, camera nearly falls Cut to Shot 5: FULL ACTION vehicles lifted and dragged, water tendrils reaching forward ahead of main wave Cut to Shot 6: IMPOSSIBLE MOMENT camera runs under a partial overhang of water collapsing mid-air Cut to Shot 7: Impact begins behind water slamming ground, explosive force chasing camera Cut to Shot 8: Camera jumps over debris as water engulfs everything around Cut to Shot 9: Final full impact, frame consumed by violent water and debris', null, null, 'Hyperrealistic catastrophic ocean event, extreme scale, violent water physics, ground-level survival perspective, continuous sprint motion, debris, wind force, pressure impact, high-speed destruction, no pauses, hard cuts only, no fade, no…', null, 'sprinting; leaping', null, null, 'ocean, beach', 'intense'),
('APX-S-2901-1', 'APX-C-2901', 1, null, null, null, null, 1, 279, '"A young woman with long dark hair, wearing a white blouse, a flowing burgundy skirt, and white sneakers, stands on the edge of a high rooftop at night, looking out over a glowing modern city.', null, null, null, null, 'rooftop', null),
('APX-S-2901-2', 'APX-C-2901', 2, null, null, null, null, 281, 254, 'Her expression turns from confusion to shock as she begins to fall. The camera follows her in a dramatic wide-angle shot as she drops between towering neon skyscrapers, with intense, spinning perspective, and speed.', null, null, null, null, null, 'intense'),
('APX-S-2901-3', 'APX-C-2901', 3, null, null, null, null, 536, 479, 'As she keeps falling, the real city seamlessly transforms into a surreal dreamlike dimension: a tunnel of colossal stone faces and metallic sculptures, floating cathedrals and shattered monuments in the clouds, giant marble statues…', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-2901-4', 'APX-C-2901', 4, null, null, null, null, 1016, 476, 'At the climax, fiery golden rings and massive spinning artifacts surround her as she reaches out in panic. Suddenly she crashes back into reality on a crowded daytime city street, stumbling forward, breathing hard, and staring directly…', null, null, null, null, 'city street', 'intense'),
