('APX-S-2886-1', 'APX-C-2886', 1, null, null, null, 'Shot on ALEXA 65mm anamorphic lens. Photorealistic cinematic quality. Aspect ratio 2.39:1 widescreen. Teal shadows, warm amber highlights. Film grain. Rain-soaked New York street at night. Neon signs, streetlights reflecting on wet asphalt. Steam rising from manholes. Lens flares, motion blur. Dolby Vision HDR. 0.0s–2.5s: Extreme low-angle tracking shot — a lone female fighter strides down a narrow NYC street, rain pouring heavily.', null, null, 'Teal shadows, warm amber highlights. Rain-soaked New York street at night. Neon signs, streetlights reflecting on wet asphalt. Steam rising from manholes.', null, 'pouring', null, null, 'new york', null),
('APX-S-2886-2', 'APX-C-2886', 2, null, null, null, 'Leather jacket soaked, hair slicked back and dripping. Heels echo faintly on wet pavement. Camera tracks backward with subtle shake. Yellow taxi lights streak across puddles. Figures step out from alleyways and fire escapes, slowly surrounding her. She tilts her head, cracks her knuckles — calm, fearless expression. 2.6s–5.0s: Whip-pan — first attacker lunges.', null, null, 'Figures step out from alleyways and fire escapes, slowly surrounding her. She tilts her head, cracks her knuckles — calm, fearless expression.', null, null, null, null, null, 'calm'),
('APX-S-2886-3', 'APX-C-2886', 3, null, null, null, 'TIME REMAP: slow-motion as she pivots smoothly, dodging and delivering a sharp elbow strike. Water sprays on impact. Her jacket snaps with the motion. Another attacker crashes into a stack of trash bags and metal bins. Sparks flicker from a flickering streetlight overhead. 5.1s–7.5s: Drone shot — overhead view as she moves fluidly through multiple opponents.', null, null, 'TIME REMAP: as she pivots smoothly, dodging and delivering a sharp elbow strike. Her jacket snaps with the motion. 5.1s–7.5s: — as she moves fluidly through multiple opponents.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-2886-4', 'APX-C-2886', 4, null, null, null, 'SLOW MOTION: precise kicks and spins land cleanly, bodies sliding across rain-slick asphalt. Steam swirls under golden streetlights. One attacker swings a bat — she catches it mid-swing, twists, and disarms them effortlessly. 7.6s–10.0s: 360° orbital shot — she leaps into a spinning kick, taking down two attackers at once. Camera circles her as another rushes from behind.', null, null, 'One attacker swings a bat — she catches it mid-swing, twists, and disarms them effortlessly. 7.6s–10.0s: 360° orbital shot — she leaps into a spinning kick, taking down two attackers at once.', null, 'leaping; sliding', null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-2886-5', 'APX-C-2886', 5, null, null, null, 'Without turning, she blocks and counters instantly. Breath visible in the cold night air. Each strike hits in sync with a rising cinematic score. 10.1s–13.0s: First-person POV — the final opponent charges. SMASH CUT: rapid, close-range exchange in slow motion. Her final punch lands clean. Silence falls. Rain continues to pour. Slow push-in — she stands alone in the empty street, adjusts her jacket sleeve, exhales steadily.', null, null, 'Without turning, she blocks and counters instantly. Her final punch lands clean. Slow — she stands alone in the empty street, adjusts her jacket sleeve, exhales steadily.', null, 'pouring', null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-2894-1', 'APX-C-2894', 1, null, null, null, 'INFINITE FALL — Beer Catch [image1] Guy: lean young man, wavy blonde hair, thin glasses, black short-sleeve open shirt, dark grey pinstripe wide-leg trousers, large silver belt buckle, brown leather loafers, arm tattoos, silver bracelets. Expression: not panicked — annoyed at the bottle, nothing more. IMAX 65mm aggressive handheld — camera itself in freefall with him, shaking slightly with air resistance, never still.', null, null, 'Aggressive — camera itself in freefall with him, shaking slightly with air resistance, never still.', null, null, 'beer', 'hero', null, null),
('APX-S-2894-2', 'APX-C-2894', 2, null, null, null, 'Fast orbital cuts, whip pans between angles, camera sometimes rushing past him at speed. Everything blown violently upward: hair, jacket, trouser legs, shirt — continuous strong upward wind throughout. The visual grammar of terminal velocity. Sound FX: constant roaring wind, fabric snapping, bottle tumbling, liquid sloshing. Environment: pure white infinite void — no ground, no ceiling, no horizon. Just white in all directions.', null, null, 'Whip pans between angles, camera sometimes rushing past him at speed.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-2894-3', 'APX-C-2894', 3, null, null, null, 'A brown glass beer bottle tumbling slowly in freefall beside him, liquid sloshing inside, just out of reach. negative: no ground, no slow camera, no calm floating — this is a violent fall The entire sequence is one continuous fall at full speed. Camera whips around him — bug''s eye from directly below looking up at him shrinking then rushing toward camera, overhead looking straight down at him, 10mm close pass inches from his face with the wind tearing at his hair and glasses, Dutch angle tracking his full body as he reaches.', null, null, 'A brown glass beer bottle tumbling slowly in freefall beside him, liquid sloshing inside, just out of reach. Camera whips around him — bug''s eye from directly below looking up at him shrinking then rushing toward camera, overhead looking…', null, null, 'beer', 'hero', null, 'calm'),
('APX-S-2894-4', 'APX-C-2894', 4, null, null, null, null, 1387, 496, 'The bottle tumbles just past his fingers — he repositions fast, body rotating in the fall, reaching again. His glasses nearly torn off by the wind, he pushes them back with one hand without stopping reaching with the other.', null, null, null, null, null, 'calm'),
('APX-S-2894-5', 'APX-C-2894', 5, null, null, null, null, 1884, 417, 'He finally grabs the bottle in one hard grip — fingers closing around the neck. He pulls it against the wind to his lips. Camera does one final fast around him — close, aggressive, whipping past.', null, 'biting', null, null, null, null),
