('APX-S-3007-1', 'APX-C-3007', 1, null, null, null, null, 1, 260, 'I tried a completely "grounded" action sequence inside a gothic cathedral, far from neon lights and exaggerated VFX. The realism level is tremendous with texture and natural lighting.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-2921-1', 'APX-C-2921', 1, null, null, null, null, 1, 261, 'The camera accelerates and locks just behind the surfboard’s tail, through the hollow tube.', null, 'driving', null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-2903-1', 'APX-C-2903', 1, null, null, null, '[Core Concept: Ultimate Tropical Escape] 1. Scene Composition and Action (Scene & Action) Opening: The viewpoint is a third-person tracking shot following a cute 20-year-old Japanese woman with brown hair from behind. She is wearing a sophisticated resort style consisting of a tropical-style crop-top camisole and tight denim hot pants, lightly pulling a pink Rimowa-style aluminum carry-on bag. She has slightly tanned skin. The location is a wooden pier (wood deck) floating over an emerald green sea. She starts running forward with considerable momentum right from the start, unable to contain her excitement.', null, null, 'She is wearing a sophisticated resort style consisting of a tropical-style crop-top camisole and tight denim hot pants, lightly pulling a pink Rimowa-style aluminum carry-on bag. She has slightly tanned skin.', null, 'sprinting', null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-2903-2', 'APX-C-2903', 2, null, null, null, 'Her strides are large, her footwork is very light, and the wheels of the carry-on bag glide smoothly in sync with her speed. Her hair and the hem of her top flutter in the wind, conveying the exhilaration of being unable to wait for her arrival. Middle Section (Room Tour): When she opens the wooden door of the modern overwater villa, a vast ocean view spreads out before her. The camera synchronizes with her movement, moving quickly and seamlessly through the living room, circular hallway, and bathroom without interruption. She maintains almost full speed even after entering the room, running with a bouncy gait.', null, null, 'Her strides are large, her footwork is very light, and the wheels of the carry-on bag glide smoothly in sync with her speed.', null, 'sprinting', null, null, 'villa, ocean, bathroom', null),
('APX-S-2903-3', 'APX-C-2903', 3, null, null, null, 'Her movement is filled with anticipation, as if she is being drawn straight to her destination. Halfway through the room, she naturally and swiftly releases the handle of the carry-on bag while running, and the bag slides along the wall due to inertia and stops quietly. She doesn''t hesitate at all and accelerates further toward the terrace. Climax: She leaps out from the villa''s terrace, runs down the stairs with almost no deceleration, and dives into the turquoise blue sea without hesitation. At this moment, her hands are free, and she jumps with her arms spread wide. A bold, expansive jump where the momentum of her run carries her into the air.', null, null, 'Her movement is filled with anticipation, as if she is being drawn straight to her destination. Halfway through the room, she naturally and swiftly releases the handle of the carry-on bag while running, and the bag slides along the wall…', null, 'sprinting; leaping; sliding', null, null, 'villa', null),
('APX-S-2903-4', 'APX-C-2903', 4, null, null, null, 'The moment she spreads her limbs wide in the air, capturing the beautiful splash of water. 2. Visual and Technical Details (Visual & Technical Details) Camera Work: Hyper-dynamic follow shot: A tracking shot that maintains a constant distance from the subject, with minimal shaking, as if using a gimbal, yet conveying overwhelming speed. One-cut style: Seamless transitions, as if filmed in a single continuous shot. The camera precisely follows her running speed, maximizing the sense of speed, immersion, and exhilaration. Emphasis is placed on a natural flow that ensures the continuity of action is not broken, even at the moment she releases the carry-on bag.', null, null, 'The moment she spreads her limbs wide in the air, capturing the beautiful splash of water. The camera precisely follows her running speed, maximizing the sense of speed, immersion, and exhilaration.', null, 'sprinting', null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-2903-5', 'APX-C-2903', 5, null, null, null, 'Lighting and Color: Crystal clear tropical daylight: A cloudless, clear sky. Sunlight pours down from directly above, and the sea surface reflects like sparkling diamonds. Color Palette: Gradations of "Cyan," "Turquoise," and "Cobalt Blue" in the sea. "Sky Blue" in the sky. "Natural Wood" and "White" in the villa. "Pure White" in her outfit. "Light Brown" in her hair color. These are set with high saturation to maximize visual satisfaction. Texture and Quality: Water: The water is extremely transparent, clear enough to see the sand ripples at the bottom. The splash when she dives is depicted with fine detail, each droplet like crystal.', null, null, '"Pure White" in her outfit. "Light Brown" in her hair color. The splash when she dives is depicted with fine detail, each droplet like crystal.', null, 'pouring', null, null, 'villa', null),
('APX-S-2903-6', 'APX-C-2903', 6, null, null, null, 'Architecture: The exterior walls of the villa have a modern design with white vertical lattices. The wooden deck floor conveys the texture of wood dried by the sun. Wardrobe & Hair: Her brown hair naturally flutters strongly in the tropical breeze, and the white crop-top camisole and hot pants emphasize a sense of openness and healthy summer style.', null, null, 'Wardrobe & Hair: Her brown hair naturally flutters strongly in the tropical breeze, and the white crop-top camisole and hot pants emphasize a sense of openness and healthy summer style.', null, null, null, null, 'villa', null),
('APX-S-2840-1', 'APX-C-2840', 1, 0, 3, 3, null, 658, 580, 'Subjective perspective (POV), the camera is aimed at the legs covered by the blanket on the bed from a first-person. The camera naturally rises with the standing motion and quickly cuts to a—the female lead is already standing by the bed…', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-2840-2', 'APX-C-2840', 2, 3, 6, 3, null, 1254, 472, 'The camera shifts to the bar area in the bedroom, with the warm light of the desk lamp and purple/yellow neon light reflecting on the wall.', null, 'pouring', 'juice', 'featured', 'bedroom', null),
('APX-S-2840-3', 'APX-C-2840', 3, 6, 9, 3, null, 1742, 377, 'The female lead holds two halves of a cut lime in her hands and squeezes them forcefully. She then grabs a handful of ice cubes and drops them into the shaker, the ice cubes colliding with a crisp sound.', null, null, 'juice; cocktail', 'featured', null, null),
('APX-S-2840-4', 'APX-C-2840', 4, 9, 12, 3, null, 2135, 397, 'The female lead holds the cocktail shaker with both hands up to the side of her face and shakes it quickly and rhythmically.', null, null, 'cocktail', 'featured', null, null),
('APX-S-2840-5', 'APX-C-2840', 5, 12, 15, 3, null, 2548, 318, 'She takes a small sip, her eyebrows relax, showing a satisfied, slightly tipsy expression. She then happily waves at the camera and freezes the frame.', null, 'biting', 'cocktail', 'featured', null, null),
